        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Boston Patriots\n- People: Lou Saban\n- Organizations: American Football League, Indiana University, Cleveland Browns, All-America Football Conference\n- Seasons: 1960 Boston Patriots season\n\nFacts:\n- Lou Saban played college football for Indiana University.\n- From 1946 to 1949, Lou Saban played professionally for the Cleveland Browns in the All-America Football Conference.\n- In 1960, the Boston Patriots finished the inaugural American Football League season with a 5–9 record.\n- In 1960, Lou Saban was the Boston Patriots' head coach.\n- In 1960, the Boston Patriots finished last in the American Football League's Eastern Division.",
